<rml>
<head>
	<title>Tomba2Engine</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="rml.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="menu.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<window id="window">
		<tab-bar id="tab-bar">
			<tab>Display</tab>
			<tab>Graphics</tab>
			<tab>Debug</tab>
			<tab>Game</tab>
			<tab>Sound</tab>
			<tab>About</tab>
		</tab-bar>
		<content id="content">
			<!-- NON-ASCII GLYPHS ARE NUMERIC CHARACTER REFERENCES: &#183; is "·", &#8212; is "—".
			     Never write an HTML entity NAME here (middot, mdash, rarr, hellip, times, copy…).
			     RML is XML-ish, not HTML: RmlUi decodes the four XML predefined names plus numeric
			     references and NOTHING else, so an unknown name is passed straight through and
			     RENDERS LITERALLY — that is exactly the bug the user reported in the readouts.
			     tests/test_rml_text_encoding.cpp lints this whole file for it, comments included,
			     which is why this note spells the names without their punctuation. -->
			<!-- One <pane> per tab; psx::ui::MenuDocument pairs the Nth <tab> with the Nth
			     <pane> and shows only the selected one (a count mismatch is now an error,
			     not a silent std::min clamp). Each focusable row is a <select-button> with a <key>
			     (label) + <value>. `tab-index: auto` (RCSS, in menu.rcss) drives Up/Down nav.
			     A row carries EXACTLY ONE of three attributes, and there is no fourth:
			       toggle="<id>"  cycles a named state (Off/On, or Vanilla/16:9/21:9/Auto)
			       adjust="<id>"  steps a number, and is the only kind Left/Right act on
			       action="<id>"  is a one-shot button (quit / close / warp_go / music_*)
			     (An earlier version of this note also listed `cycle="<id>"`. NOTHING has ever
			     read that attribute — a row carrying it would be inert. `toggle` already
			     handles multi-state rows. Do not reintroduce it.)
			     An id psx::ui::ModRowModel does not know is now reported as an error at load
			     instead of producing a dead row. The value text is refreshed from live state
			     by psx::ui::MenuDocument every frame the menu is open. -->
			<pane>
				<div id="video_readout" class="readout">render -</div>
				<div id="world_readout" class="readout"></div>

				<div class="section-heading">Display</div>
				<select-button toggle="render_path"><key>Renderer</key><value>Native / PC</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="aspect"><key>Aspect Ratio</key><value>Vanilla</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="ires"><key>Internal Resolution</key><value>Vanilla</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="fps60"><key>60fps Interpolation</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="face_order"><key>Face Ordering</key><value>Depth (enhanced)</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">&#8596; switch tab &#183; &#8597; move &#183; Enter / A change &#183; Esc close</p>
			</pane>

			<pane>
				<div class="section-heading">Ambient Occlusion</div>
				<select-button toggle="ssao"><key>SSAO</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="ssao_strength"><key>AO Strength</key><value>1.00</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="ssao_radius"><key>AO Radius (px)</key><value>6.0</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="ssao_bias"><key>AO Bias</key><value>0.020</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="ssao_range"><key>AO Range</key><value>0.200</value></select-button>

				<div class="section-heading spaced">Lighting</div>
				<select-button toggle="light"><key>Directional Light</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="light_dir_x"><key>Light Dir X</key><value>0.00</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="light_dir_y"><key>Light Dir Y</key><value>0.00</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="light_dir_z"><key>Light Dir Z</key><value>1.00</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="light_ambient"><key>Ambient</key><value>0.50</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="light_diffuse"><key>Diffuse</key><value>0.70</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="shadows"><key>Dynamic Shadows</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<select-button adjust="shadow_strength"><key>Shadow Strength</key><value>0.60</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">&#8596; switch tab &#183; &#8597; move &#183; Enter / A change &#183; Esc close</p>
			</pane>

			<pane>
				<div class="section-heading">Debug</div>
				<select-button toggle="debug_quads"><key>Highlight Quads (billboards)</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<select-button toggle="debug_objects"><key>Highlight 3D Objects</key><value>Off</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">Boxes each game object at its world position + shows id and WORLD x,y,z. Quads (2D sprites at 3D positions) are yellow; 3D meshes are cyan.</p>

				<div class="section-heading spaced">Area Warp</div>
				<div id="warp_readout" class="readout"></div>
				<select-button adjust="warp_area"><key>Destination</key><value>Area 0</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="warp_go"><key>Warp There</key><value>&#8594;</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">Only from the field &#8212; the warp runs the game's own door transition (fade, teardown, reload), so it needs a running field. Unnamed areas show as "Area N"; names live in docs/areas.md.</p>
				<p class="hint">&#8596; switch tab &#183; &#8597; move &#183; Enter / A change &#183; Esc close</p>
			</pane>

			<pane>
				<div class="section-heading">Game</div>
				<select-button action="close"><key>Resume</key><value>&#8629;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="quit"><key>Quit Game</key><value>&#10005;</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">&#8596; switch tab &#183; &#8597; move &#183; Enter / A select &#183; Esc close</p>
			</pane>

			<pane>
				<div class="section-heading">Sound Test</div>
				<div id="music_readout" class="readout">stopped</div>
				<select-button action="music_0"><key>Song 0 (jingle)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_1"><key>Song 1 (jingle)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_2"><key>Song 2 (jingle)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_3"><key>Song 3 (jingle)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_4"><key>Song 4 (cue)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_5"><key>Song 5 (cue)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_6"><key>Song 6 (cue)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_7"><key>Song 7 (field)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_8"><key>Song 8 (field)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_9"><key>Song 9 (field)</key><value>&#9654;</value></select-button>
				<select-button action="music_stop"><key>Stop</key><value>&#9632;</value></select-button>
				<p class="hint">Native PC audio engine (engine/audio/) &#183; replaces the libsnd music path.</p>
				<p class="hint">&#8596; switch tab &#183; &#8597; move &#183; Enter / A play &#183; Esc close</p>
			</pane>

			<pane>
				<div class="section-heading">About</div>
				<p>Tomba! 2 &#8212; PC-native engine port (Tomba2Engine).</p>
				<p class="hint">RmlUi (HTML/CSS) menu over the Vulkan renderer. Layout from Dusklight (CC0).</p>
			</pane>
		</content>
	</window>
</body>
</rml>
